Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,数十亿年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billions of years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群不朽者掌握了宇宙间最强大的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}a race of immortals harnessed the most powerful force in existence:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色的意志力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emerald energy of willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群不朽的宇宙守卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}These immortals, the Guardians of the Universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立了一个世界 守望着宇宙间的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}built a world from where they could watch over all of existence:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧阿行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The planet Oa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将宇宙分为3600个扇区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They divided the universe into 3600 sectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:01:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枚意志力附魔的戒指被分配到每个扇区来招募成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ring powered by the energy of will was sent to every sector to select a recruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能被戒指选中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to be chosen by the ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说必须是“无畏者”\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was said one must be without fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,3600名成员一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, these 3600 recruits…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,组成了银河和平保卫者 名曰“绿灯军团”\N{\fnArial\fs30}formed the intergalactic peacekeepers known as the Green Lantern Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.93,Title,0,0,0,0,,《绿灯侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,军团历尽劫难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the threats the Corps ever faced…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大的威胁是恐惧化身的实体 名曰“视差怪”\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gravest was an entity of fear known as Parallax.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯独传奇绿灯侠 阿宾·苏尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the legendary Green Lantern Abin Sur…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,能将这匹恶魔捕获并囚禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}was capable of capturing and imprisoning this beast…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.35,0:01:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在失落的行星莱厄特 他成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he did on the lost planet of Ryut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:53.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莱厄特行星： 失落的扇区）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:07.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（探索者6号呼叫基地： 我们的飞船坠毁于失落扇区的东北）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:12.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请求立即支援）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 总是要讨论这个 - 不是每次都得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, we go into this every time. - It's not every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的 想想以前的 想一想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, honey. Think back. Think back. Think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次我是没事 我真的没事 你的工作对我没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was fine the last time. I'm usually fine. I'm fine with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能和你谈谈吗？ - 你当然可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I just tell you something? - Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我害怕 亲爱的 - 嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm scared, honey. - Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你妈妈总是在试飞的前夜焦虑不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know how Mom gets the night before a test flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不害怕吧 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not scared, are you, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是我的工作不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say it's my job not to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 你要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal, you're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 妈妈 得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mom. Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为会突破3马赫速度吗？ - 不久我们就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think she'll break mach 3? - We'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该在学校吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shouldn't you be in school?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,费瑞斯先生调高了机尾的稳定器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ferris raised the rear stabilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是调高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,偏航率陀螺仪已校准了 但倾斜角偏低了2度\N{\fnArial\fs30}The yaw rate gyros are calibrated, but the pitch is off 2 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会适应的 惯性导航系统怎样？ - 准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can live with that. How about the INS? - Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 务必检查一下点火顺序 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be sure to check the ignition sequences. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查过了 卡尔 两次 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We did, Carl, twice. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有陀螺仪呢？做过陀螺仪校准吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, the gyros? Did we do the gyro calibrations?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:07:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许哈尔愿意上你的办公室和凯罗尔一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Hal would like to join Carol up in your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两个可以一起观看试飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of them can watch together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 年轻人 去见凯罗尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, young man. Let's go find Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我暖着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it warm for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 哦 哈克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Oh, hey, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我有了这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. So, um, I have this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于外星球存在生命的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the possibility of life on other planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酷 - 差不多是存在的 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cool. - Well, it almost has to exist, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈尔！ - 凯罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hal! - Hey, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈克特 你还在卖风火轮吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector. You still wanna trade Hot Wheels?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧谁在这里 是我们将来的试飞员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look who's here. Our future test pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹克很配你 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacket suits you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 爸爸 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Dad. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是和哈克特说 书很有趣 但偶尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep telling Hector, books are fun, but every once in a while…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞出这个世界也并不是一个坏主意 对吗 哈尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not such a bad idea to get out in the world, right, Hal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 鲍伯 - 当前的大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Bob. - The man of the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有像第一次试飞这样让我热血沸腾的了 是吧 卡尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like a first flight to get the blood boiling, eh, Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我们能在场地上观看试飞吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, can we watch from down in the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以 - 太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要小心点 - 和工程师们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You kids be careful. - Stay with the engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,去啊 儿子 看得更近一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, son. See it up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 爸爸 我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, Dad. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥塔 我是军刀一号 已准备起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ferris Tower, Sabre One, ready for take-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求无限制爬升 飞行水平高度450\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request unrestricted climb, flight level 450.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀一号 同意你无限制爬升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabre One, unrestricted climb approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达1万英尺高度时联系费瑞斯起飞点\N{\fnArial\fs30}On passing 10, 000 feet, contact Ferris Departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已准许起飞了 祝好运 军刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cleared for take-off. Good luck, Sabre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:03.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（今日）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:06.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2814扇区）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛纳斯丘 我现在是最大速度航行了 告诉凡塔拉我将…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinestro, I'm traveling at maximum velocity. Tell Fentara I should…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡塔拉死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fentara is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,行星居民呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The planet's inhabitants?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必撤离他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission to evacuate them is no longer necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,和塔洛克的情况一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just as it was on Talok.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有生命体都被毁灭 生命精华被吸干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every life form destroyed and their essence absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处是黄色能量的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traces of yellow power everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫者呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Guardians?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫者们销声匿迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Guardians are silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求一位观察者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've demanded an audience with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宾·苏尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abin Sur.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身负重伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm badly wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往最近的可居住行星 开始挑选程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading to the nearest inhabited planet for the selection process.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知守卫者们 是视差怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the Guardians it's Parallax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 要闪了 你就当在自己家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I gotta run. Make yourself at home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么 要喝水有自来水\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, uh, water in the tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.72,0:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.39,0:15:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,费瑞斯军刀三号 是人工智能战机的艺术典范\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ferris Sabre III is state-of-the-art of artificial-intelligence fighter planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,具备人类驾驶员飞行和格斗的一切能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has all of the flying and combat capability of a human pilot…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不似人类那样犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with none of the human error that comes with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 卡尔可不是为了得到合同而吹牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl isn't just blowing smoke to get a contract, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的幕僚 他的承包商 我的办公室 都参与其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your staff, these contractors, my office…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,全程我们参与了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've all been part of this from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,钦佩备至 参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I appreciate that, senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 要大显身手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today the rubber meets the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个模拟战斗环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a simulated combat situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,两架军刀对阵卡尔的两个王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two Sabres against Carl's two best pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿凯罗尔 我今天想飞一下 你觉得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol. Was gonna do a little flying today. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 只是因为睡过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but that's only because I slept in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾睡过头 但是在11岁以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to sleep in. Then I turned 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a little heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一整周都在对付这个两架军刀 次次被它们羞辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gone up against these Sabres all week and they smoked me every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做的一切 它都胜你一筹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't anything you can do that they can't do better, faster…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且从不让女人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and without disappointing women everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都清楚 那是胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, think we both know that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我不想你参加 可我父亲坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is exactly why I didn't want you for this. My father did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望是詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've gone with Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望是詹森 不巧 他忙 而且也不咋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have too, but unfortunately he's busy not being good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码他不迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least he shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的测试 很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}this test today, it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解 你上天后有好瞧的 别着急 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make you look good up there. Don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我脱了这裤子 去开飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's get these pants off and fly some planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,高手 武器检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highball, weapon check now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 费瑞斯先生 - 早上好 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Mr. Ferris. - Morning, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就绪了吗 汤姆？ - 是的 费瑞斯先生 准备测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We about ready, Tom? - Yes, Mr. Ferris. We are go for test.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝宝石 最后一次武器检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sapphire, cleared weapons hot at the merge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,费瑞斯测试中心 蓝宝石武器正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ferris Test, Sapphire. Weapons are hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全飞行 高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly safe, Highball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,额…不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他娘的 汤姆 它们吃什么长大的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it! Tom, what the hell you feed those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,F35咯 还能有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}F-35s, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 蓝宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakey, wakey, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要开火 现在是个好机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a shot, now would be a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 高手 正在就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, Highball. Just lining it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能单独对付它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we're taking these out solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来 我们想点办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here. Let's figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来 高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way, Highball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持方位 飞漂亮点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now stay right there and look real pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,高手 你用你的僚机做诱饵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highball, did you just use your wingman as a decoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,高手 军刀就在你后面 你去哪它们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highball, those Sabres headed up your 6 can fly anywhere you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那咱们去我去不了的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's go somewhere I can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这是要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去棺材角（飞机失速高度）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffin corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,高手 交战法则设定限高50，000英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highball, rules of engagement set ceiling at 50, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 因为再飞高点 军刀会失速 对吗 汤姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because the Sabres will stall if they go any higher, right, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会失速\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so will you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,压缩机失速 压缩机失速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compressor stall. Compressor stall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 他娘的 哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I mean, damn it, Hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小子工作很执着嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy certainly takes his job seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,副翼 哈尔 左右摇摆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ailerons, Hal. Side to side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我暖着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it warm for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过25，000英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going through 25, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 高手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you okay, Highball?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.43,0:21:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 庆祝一下胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just taking my victory lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到达20，000英尺 - 好了 高手 给点反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Going through 20, 000. - Okay, Highball, give me some roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒 爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 听得清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,高手 你正在接近弹射极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highball, you're approaching minimum ejection altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,高手 你已经坠过10，000英尺 失速无法恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highball, you're below 10, 000 AGL. Spin is unrecoverable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹射 弹射 弹射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eject, eject, eject!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不害怕吧 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared, are you, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说 我的工作不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say it's my job not to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狗娘养的蠢货！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid son of a bitch. You…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 鲍勃 现在无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, Bob. It doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.35,0:22:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.69,0:22:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那架崭新的F35坠毁了没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that you crashed a brand-new F-35.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.77,0:22:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你破坏了交战规则 你牺牲了你的僚机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke the rules of engagement. You sacrificed your wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且搞砸了整个公司和半个州寄予厚望的合同\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you blew the contract this company was depending on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我以为这是你死我活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I thought this was a dogfight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为我的目标是胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was under the impression the objective was to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是为了展示军刀在实战中的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the objective was to show what the Sabres could do in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,实战中 没人会牺牲自己的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in combat, no pilot is gonna crater his own plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你知道应该提高无人机的飞行高限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know you gotta boost the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.22,0:23:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也展示了它们做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed you what they can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必在空军军事检察官面前展示这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to make that point in front of Air Force Acquisitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.01,0:23:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 凯罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正这公司大多数要下岗 你被开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I'm gonna have to lay off most of my company anyway, you're fired, Hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了 卡尔 我辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late. I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能开除他 你也不能辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not fired and you don't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.23,0:23:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被拘禁了 等待调查结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're grounded, pending the results of an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.11,0:23:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不大会 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我怎么回事？ - 控制锁定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me what happened. - Controls locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.21,0:23:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别胡扯 哈尔 你有机会再点火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me that, Hal. You had a window when you could've recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你窒息了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you choke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.51,0:23:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是第一个出这种事的飞行员 我要知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be the first, but I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制被锁定了 这到底是怎么回事 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My controls locked up. What the hell is all this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.68,0:23:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这身可笑的行头是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the ridiculous suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.35,0:23:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你父亲一直在帮你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your dad's been bucking for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我职业的选择…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The merits of my career choices…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个飞行员 优秀的飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a pilot, and a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在办公室桌上怎么飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving that up to fly a desk is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 我喜欢商务工作 我也很擅长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it and I'm good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.15,0:24:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 也不一定我就进不了驾驶舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean I'll never get in a cockpit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是非此即彼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有孩子才这么想问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way a child looks at things,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.73,0:24:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we aren't children anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.58,0:24:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想我在乎的人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't wanna see someone I care about getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least of all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑选一个意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.27,0:25:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个测试飞行员的大胆缠斗差点酿成悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A test pilot's daring maneuvers almost ended in tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.32,0:25:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击者称 飞行员哈尔·乔丹在最后一刻弹射跳伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witnesses say pilot Hal Jordan ejected at the last possible second…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.95,0:25:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的座机坠落在沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}before his jet crashed in the open desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父亲马丁·乔丹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the son of the late Martin Jordan…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.29,0:25:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1993年的飞行测试惨剧中丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was killed in his own ill-fated test flight back in 1993.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.50,0:25:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说哈尔·乔丹目前状况良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are told that Hal Jordan is doing fine right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们尚未听到任何费瑞斯公司的官方声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}though we have yet to hear an official statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.21,0:25:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.42,0:25:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The incident has been a blow to a new high-tech aircraft program…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.17,0:25:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. How was work?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.76,0:26:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 棒极了 杰克 谢谢关心 嘿 简尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. It was amazing, Jack. Thank you for asking. Hey, Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.51,0:26:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看现在的情况 我很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just help me out here, because I'm really trying to understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.81,0:26:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太想学他了 也想和他死得一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna be like him so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.85,0:26:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为是我的失误？ - 我问过卡尔 哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just assume it's my fault. - I talked to Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你驾驶飞机到了极限高度…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pushed the plane past its limits…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的工作 一场事故 大家都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my job. It was an accident. Everybody walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.53,0:26:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那次摩托车事故让你住了一个月医院吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your motorcycle accident that put you in the hospital for a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想念这美好的家庭时光 聊得很愉快 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss all this quality family time. Good talk, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.71,0:26:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.05,0:26:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.64,0:26:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 是我哈尔叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Uncle Hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.14,0:26:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 王牌飞行员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up there, ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.35,0:26:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我参加的最糟的11岁生日聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the worst 11 th birthday party I've ever been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.27,0:26:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没跳舞的女孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dancing girls? What's going on…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.60,0:26:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.82,0:26:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我有点吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I got a little freaked out or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:27:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.45,0:27:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.24,0:27:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have anything to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.91,0:27:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许生活中很多事情我都会搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I may be a total screw-up in every other part of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.67,0:27:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可有件事我很清楚 飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the one thing I do know how to do is fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.05,0:27:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去了解这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I used to know this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.47,0:27:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个有趣的小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a funny-looking little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.93,0:27:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 他站在土堆上 掷出了一场完美的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, he's standing on the mound, and he throws a perfect game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.72,0:27:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他… 他就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.39,0:27:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为很熟悉你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you looked familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.48,0:27:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天你完全处于巅峰状态 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were totally in the zone that day. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.87,0:27:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我仍梦见这些 - 我确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I still dream about it. - I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.08,0:27:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.42,0:27:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.71,0:28:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能精确记起那天你是怎样的感受吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you remember exactly how you felt that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.97,0:28:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我飞行时就是那种感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I feel when I'm flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.27,0:28:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像飞机成为我自身的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that plane is a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.60,0:28:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就像是 不管情况多糟糕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's like, no matter how bad things get…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.27,0:28:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,总还是有好的一面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something good out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅需越过地平线\N{\fnArial\fs30}just over the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.12,0:28:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的可以感受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could really feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.37,0:28:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.08,0:28:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.05,0:28:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有礼物给你 小寿星 我自己包的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, got you something, birthday boy. Wrapped it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了 这是X-1 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. It's an X-1, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.52,0:28:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空战斗机 我爸爸送我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Starfighter. My dad gave me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.77,0:29:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它挂起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.65,0:29:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened today?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机坠毁的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, when you crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.28,0:29:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really sure, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.33,0:29:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.79,0:29:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不害怕是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job not to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁你还没错过你超级烂的生日派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're totally missing your super-lame birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.13,0:29:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去！走 走 走 走 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat it. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.47,0:29:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too, ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.82,0:29:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.00,0:29:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.39,0:31:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别死 别死 我找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, stay with me. Stay with me. I'm gonna get you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.35,0:31:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 你会没事的 坚持一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be okay. You're gonna be okay. Okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.02,0:31:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么？你叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name. Your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.49,0:31:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫哈尔 哈尔·乔丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Hal. Hal Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.32,0:31:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔·乔丹，我是阿宾·苏尔 2814扇区的守卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal Jordan, I am Abin Sur, protector of Sector 2814.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.41,0:31:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿 好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.83,0:31:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你去医院 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you to a hospital, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.56,0:31:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？给你输点紫色的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? One that carries purple blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.84,0:31:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.04,0:31:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,选中了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.21,0:31:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.72,0:31:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上戒指 放进灯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place the ring in the lantern.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.80,0:31:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上戒指 宣读誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place the ring, speak the oath…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.81,0:31:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 巨大的荣誉和责任…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Great honor, responsibility…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.18,0:31:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 嘿 继续呼吸 你要呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. Breathe. You gotta breathe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.94,0:31:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要呼吸 吸气 吸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is breathe. Just breathe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.56,0:31:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不 不 不 嘿 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. No, no, no. Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.65,0:31:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 伙计 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Come on, man. No, no, no, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.57,0:31:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 别…这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, now, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.91,0:31:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.30,0:32:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,X-97系统检测完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-97 systems check complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.87,0:32:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.96,0:32:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a spaceship?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.13,0:32:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真家伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.55,0:32:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.30,0:32:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看动力系统是怎样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see what kind of power source this thing uses?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.97,0:32:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看有什么新发现 - 我们不能留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you understand… - We can't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.93,0:32:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能留下 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't stay here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.35,0:32:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得离开 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gotta go. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.93,0:33:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.31,0:33:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他穿着制服 我想他是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wore a uniform. I think he was a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.39,0:33:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把这个交给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.90,0:33:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他求婚了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He proposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.40,0:33:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gone. We're gone, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会知道有人来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna know someone was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.01,0:33:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星飞行员不会把自己埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien pilots don't bury themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能就这样把他留在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't just leave him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.51,0:33:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿这个东西没辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope this thing isn't radioactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真是个天才！你… - 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, well, you're the genius. You… Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.68,0:33:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊！- 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! - Aah! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 是戒指选中了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that the ring chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.82,0:33:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这是莫大的荣耀和责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was a great honor. Responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.66,0:33:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,责任？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:33:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在他们的星球上 责任是混蛋的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe on their planet "responsibility" just means "asshole."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.08,0:34:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.10,0:34:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙中一束巨大的光芒熄灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great light has gone out in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.31,0:34:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宾·苏尔死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abin Sur is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.52,0:34:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,4个绿灯兄弟被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four of my Lantern brothers killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.23,0:34:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个星球的居民被未知的敌人灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inhabitants of two worlds annihilated by an unknown enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.74,0:34:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个掌握了黄色恐惧力量的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enemy that possesses the yellow power of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.29,0:34:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道它来源于失落的扇区某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know it originated from within the Lost Sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.96,0:34:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道 每次遭遇都使其更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know it grows more powerful with each encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.34,0:34:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据阿宾·苏尔丢失的讯息 他似乎知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Abin Sur's last transmission, he seemed to know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.63,0:35:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只说了一句话：“是视差怪”\N{\fnArial\fs30}His only words were, "It's Parallax."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.48,0:35:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道这个危机了 我们正在评估\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are aware of the threat. We are assessing the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.65,0:35:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在评估 无辜的生命却在消逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you assess, innocent lives will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.53,0:35:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我向这个新敌人宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take the fight to this enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.45,0:35:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他知之甚少 辛纳斯丘\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is much of which you are not aware, Sinestro.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.12,0:35:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个威胁和我们预料的一样强大…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the danger is as great as we suspect…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.04,0:35:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.62,0:35:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他可以打败我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe this enemy can defeat us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.30,0:35:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫者们 如果你们的信念有所削弱 让我来提醒你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardians, if your faith in our power has faltered, let me renew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我带一群最强大的军团战士去对抗这个敌人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take a squadron of my strongest Lanterns against this enemy…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.60,0:35:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向你们证明我们的黄金岁月并未过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll prove to you our best days are not behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.22,0:36:26.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（崛起的新星）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.69,0:36:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩蒙德博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hammond?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.90,0:36:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈克特·韩蒙德博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hector Hammond?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你跟我们走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to ask you to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.36,0:36:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是亚当要你们来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Adam put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.13,0:37:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.89,0:37:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩蒙德博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hammond?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.51,0:37:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿曼达·沃勒博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Amanda Waller.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.85,0:37:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉如此大动干戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must apologize for the theatrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可政府有它的做事方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the government does like its protocols.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.73,0:37:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是真的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.84,0:38:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个外星生命体 博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An alien life form, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类接触的第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first that mankind has ever encountered…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.26,0:38:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和阴谋论的说法截然不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}despite what the conspiracy theorists would have you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.85,0:38:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望你来进行第一次生理分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want you to do the initial assessment of its physiology.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.73,0:38:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.65,0:38:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.11,0:38:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个齐诺生物学家 你的能力最适合这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a xenobiologist, your skills are specifically suited to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.74,0:38:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,此外…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond that…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.99,0:38:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能守口如瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not at liberty to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.16,0:38:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.07,0:39:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛 鼻子 耳和嘴与人类相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eyes, nose, ears and mouth are humanoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.53,0:39:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在左前胸区域 有个直径约10厘米…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the left anterior thoracic region is a 10-centimeter wound…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.99,0:39:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸液腐蚀的创口 有紫色凝血\N{\fnArial\fs30}with jagged edges containing attached cyanotic-colored coagulum.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.46,0:39:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.71,0:39:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上戒指 宣读誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place the ring, then speak the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.05,0:39:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都知道誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because everybody knows the oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.47,0:39:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练营里还唱了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to sing it in camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.89,0:39:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 哈尔·乔丹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, Hal Jordan…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,庄严宣誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}do solemnly swear…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.52,0:40:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣誓效忠…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pledge allegiance…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.90,0:40:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,于一盏绿灯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a lantern…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.48,0:40:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个紫色的外星人弥留之际传给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I got from a dying purple alien…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.90,0:40:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,身下一片沼泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.66,0:40:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,表皮呈绛红色\N{\fnArial\fs30}The epidermis is magenta.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.74,0:40:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去透明 超薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears transparent and is extremely thin…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.79,0:40:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以看到肌肉组织和肌肉纤维\N{\fnArial\fs30}allowing visualization of muscles and individual muscle fibers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.00,0:40:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,矢志不移\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To infinity and beyond."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:31.09,Title,0,0,0,0,,灰壳堡赐予我力量吧！（出自《宇宙巨人希曼》）\N{\fnArial\fs30}"By the power of Grayskull."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.26,0:40:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底要怎样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.93,0:40:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能载我飞几百英里然后落在一块荒地上 你难道就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can fly me 100 miles in the middle of nowhere, you'd think that you…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.26,0:40:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.40,0:40:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,白昼朗朗 黑夜茫茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}In brightest day, in blackest night…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.03,0:40:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魅魍魉 无所遁藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}no evil shall escape my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.70,0:41:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪科奸党 惧吾神光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let those who worship evil's might…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.54,0:41:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯长明\N{\fnArial\fs30}beware my power:
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.59,0:41:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,万世光芒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green Lantern's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.48,0:41:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.40,0:41:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切还好吧？ - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything okay in there? - It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.82,0:41:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能进来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.07,0:41:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.32,0:41:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 哦 不行 因为我们… 你想喝一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, because we're… Uh, do you wanna get a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.83,0:41:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以谈谈吗？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we talk? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.45,0:41:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈 喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk and drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的初步分析 - 谢谢 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My initial analysis. - Thank you, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.05,0:42:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再重复一个简单的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to tell you that the mere fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.85,0:42:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它与人类相似 太奇特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it's humanoid is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.81,0:42:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种同向的变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's indicating a convergent evolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.31,0:42:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有共同的祖先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or perhaps a common ancestry…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.98,0:42:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的发现真是石破惊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the implications of that are staggering.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.53,0:42:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来自何方呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.28,0:42:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能彻底改变整个世界审视自己的角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could completely change the way that the world views itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.70,0:42:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象公众对此会有什么反应吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You imagine the way that the public will react to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.54,0:42:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我知道这不可能 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, but I know that that won't happen. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.79,0:42:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我和你一样 想要追寻真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like yourself, doctor, I'm a seeker of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.96,0:42:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可资助这个机构的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the people who pay for facilities like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.71,0:42:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其它的考虑 并贯彻始终\N{\fnArial\fs30}have other priorities and the power to enforce them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.55,0:42:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我会保密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.55,0:42:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样的人必须在体制内行事 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like us have to work within the system, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.39,0:42:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总是尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do the best we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.14,0:42:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.10,0:42:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把球拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.44,0:42:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.90,0:42:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.90,0:42:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会道歉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.57,0:43:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是外星人上身了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been replaced by an alien or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.54,0:43:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.25,0:43:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.08,0:43:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.42,0:43:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 好极了 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, totally good. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.42,0:43:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我没有责任感吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'm irresponsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.05,0:43:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用回答 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to answer. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.93,0:43:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.15,0:43:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.94,0:43:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好久没来这里了 自从…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we haven't been in this place together since…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.61,0:43:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.78,0:43:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你忘记了我的生日 - 有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You forgot it was my birthday. - Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.62,0:43:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.12,0:43:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是在那一晚 我们第一次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was also the night… The first time that we ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.29,0:43:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}flew together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.63,0:44:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后你一直在飞行 搭档换了又换\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been flying ever since with anyone who'd get in the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.43,0:44:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.93,0:44:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.15,0:44:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 陪我跳舞吧 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dance with me. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.82,0:44:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 不跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.91,0:44:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.46,0:44:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.50,0:44:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 合约不是完全没希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. It's okay. The contract isn't quite dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.55,0:44:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你我不擅长这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I was good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.13,0:44:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking about the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.97,0:44:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我们的分开 你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've screwed this up. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.10,0:44:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我没加入空军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I didn't go to the Air Force…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.48,0:45:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会以某种方式…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've found some way to…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.82,0:45:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞砸我们的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, I would've blown it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.23,0:45:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这么对自己说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, is that what you tell yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.78,0:45:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么对自己说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. What do you tell yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕我们太过亲近\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you were scared I was getting too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.88,0:45:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我整个下午在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I spent my afternoon doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.42,0:45:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worrying about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.05,0:45:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仔细看过飞行记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went over every inch of the flight data.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.45,0:45:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机是没有任何问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing wrong with the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.68,0:45:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当时发生什么事了？ - 谢谢跟我跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened up there? - Thanks for the dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.42,0:46:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过当心背后 乔丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.51,0:46:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们都失业了 你这狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cost us all our jobs, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.95,0:46:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.91,0:46:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这杂种一辈子都活在你父亲的光环下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard's been living off his old man's reputation his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.50,0:46:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.88,0:46:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.63,0:46:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脸才刚刚热呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My face is just getting warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.38,0:50:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我欣赏结束了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you concluded admiring yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.97,0:50:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.97,0:51:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你的戒指翻译功能还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your ring translator is functioning properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.97,0:51:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要身份保密的时候 你的面罩就会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mask will appear when protection of your identity is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.31,0:51:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在欧阿星上就不需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no need for it on Oa.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.44,0:51:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一条会说话的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A talking fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.23,0:51:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是祖达里安人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, my race is Xudarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.06,0:51:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的基因确与你们的鱼类生物相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our DNA does somewhat resemble your own ichthyological species.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是托马·雷 2813扇区的守卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Tomar-Re, protector of Sector 2813 and home to…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.16,0:51:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,包含80，012个银河系 234万种已知生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}80, 012 galaxies, 2.34 million sentient species.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.54,0:51:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.79,0:51:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是知识植入\N{\fnArial\fs30}The induction process.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.58,0:51:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能开启戒指的高级功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It activates the ring's higher functions,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.81,0:51:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括有效知识库\N{\fnArial\fs30}including a working knowledge base.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.21,0:51:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我们很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}In truth, we were curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.59,0:51:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑选程序从未作用于人类这么年轻的种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}The process had never been attempted on a species as young as humans before.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.22,0:51:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是第一个被选中的人类 我被派来迎接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you are the first to be chosen, I've been sent to welcome you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.56,0:51:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here is?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.77,0:51:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到欧阿行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Oa.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.40,0:52:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数年来 这里一直是我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This planet has been our home for countless millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.12,0:52:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,由守卫者为我们创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was created for us by the Guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardians?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.12,0:52:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们站在圣殿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There stands their Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.54,0:52:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是远古种族中的不朽者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are immortals, among the most ancient of races.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.88,0:52:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们创造了这一切 负责我们的存在与言行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made all you see and are responsible for all we are and do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.88,0:52:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,远古时期 绿灯军团就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since time immemorial, the Green Lantern Corps…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙和平、秩序和正义的守卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}has served as the keepers of peace, order and justice throughout the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.72,0:52:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,被选中加入其中 是莫大的荣耀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be chosen to join its ranks is the highest of honors…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.73,0:52:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是莫大的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the greatest of responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.23,0:52:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这话我听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, that part I heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.44,0:52:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在开始飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to fly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.99,0:52:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞行？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fly? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.24,0:52:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.62,0:52:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能飞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.67,0:52:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.79,0:52:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能飞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.85,0:53:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.43,0:53:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是中央能量池产生的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the energy that's generated from the Central Battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.52,0:53:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的能量来自于宇宙中所有生物的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its power comes from the will of every living creature in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.44,0:54:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它为你的灯提供能量 灯为戒指提供能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, in turn, charges your lantern, which, in turn, charges your ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服也是纯粹的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even your suit is comprised entirely of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.40,0:54:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么都是绿色的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with all the green?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.91,0:54:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色是意志的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green is the color of will.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.53,0:54:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫者利用意志…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Guardians harnessed will…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.24,0:54:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它是宇宙间最强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's the strongest source of energy in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.75,0:54:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.59,0:54:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在晴朗的夜晚 你在母星上看能到的星球…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars you can see from your home planet on the clearest night…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.38,0:54:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你扇区的千分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}your sector is a thousand times larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.80,0:54:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,3600盏灯各对应一个扇区 亦同样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And 3600 Lanterns, each with a sector just as vast.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.70,0:55:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯战士们 我召集你们来参加这次前所未有的聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lanterns, I've called you here to this unprecedented gathering…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.25,0:55:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们正面临前所未有的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we face an unprecedented danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.17,0:55:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,4位绿灯同袍已被害 凶手就是视差怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our four Lantern brothers were killed by an enemy called Parallax.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个我们尚未完全了解的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enemy we don't yet fully understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.60,0:55:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们知道 它已强大到彻底摧毁一个文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do know it's powerful enough to destroy entire civilizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.65,0:55:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大到 能打败阿宾·苏尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful enough to defeat even Abin Sur…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.07,0:55:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最精英的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}our finest warrior…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.65,0:55:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的存在无人可替代\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose light can never be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.16,0:55:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫者们命令我带领我们最强大的战士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Guardians have charged me to lead a squadron of Lanterns…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.75,0:55:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去进攻视差怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an assault on Parallax.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.67,0:55:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会搜索并找到这个强敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will seek out and find this enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.80,0:55:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将打败它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.67,0:55:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,单体 我们是脆弱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone, we are now vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.76,0:55:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,团结 我们仍然无坚不摧\N{\fnArial\fs30}United, we are still invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.02,0:55:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从未失利过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have never been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.27,0:56:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在会失利吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will we be defeated now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.31,0:56:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.44,0:56:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的存在就是为了这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was for this moment that we were created.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.15,0:56:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不必再赘述你们的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't need to tell you your duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.45,0:56:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不必再赘述我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to tell you who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.04,0:56:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯军团！绿灯军团！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Corps! We are the Corps!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.79,0:56:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯军团！绿灯军团！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Corps! We are the Corps!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.93,0:56:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意志能将想象变成现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will turns thought into reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.89,0:56:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要支配你的戒指 你必须集中你的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}To master the ring, you must learn to focus your will…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.72,0:56:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,将脑中幻想变为现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}and create what you see in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.06,0:56:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指的极限 就是你想象的极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring's limits are only what you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.99,0:56:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.49,0:56:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.99,0:56:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.55,0:57:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有外来威胁 戒指会发出警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring will inform you where there is an imminent threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.18,0:57:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的威胁名叫基洛沃格\N{\fnArial\fs30}This particular threat's name is Kilowog.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.19,0:57:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的格斗教官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be your combat training officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.02,0:57:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇！- 绝不要放松警惕 废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Never let your guard down, poozer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.44,0:57:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到101摔打场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Ring Slinging 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.78,0:57:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 如我常说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or as I like to call it:
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.53,0:57:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你黯淡生命的最糟一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst day of your worthless life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.95,0:57:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 以前从来没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human. Ain't never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.50,0:57:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你闻起来好怪 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You smell funny. - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.96,0:57:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻起来好怪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.17,0:57:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过人类自以为是宇宙的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard about humans. Think you're the center of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.13,0:57:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做绿灯战士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be a Lantern?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.72,0:57:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得献身军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta commit to the Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.43,0:58:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 废物 看看你有什么能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, poozer. Let's see what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.16,0:58:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的创造只会和你的意志一样弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your constructs are only gonna be as strong as your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.83,0:58:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意志弱的可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your will is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.17,0:58:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我整你 我会一直打击你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna work you and I'm gonna hit you…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.54,0:58:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你的意志配得上绿灯军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}until your will is strong enough to be worthy of the Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.02,0:58:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 有感觉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha. Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.69,0:58:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是普通恒星的引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the gravitational pull of your average sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.49,0:58:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此太空飞行非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes flying through space very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.11,0:59:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,个头越大 引力越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bigger you are, the quicker you burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.83,0:59:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,引力是个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.62,0:59:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 拉你起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.55,0:59:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 你的敌人不会手软\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, your enemy, he's not gonna play fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.89,0:59:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这建议不错 谢了 美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's good advice. Thanks, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.02,0:59:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.02,0:59:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the human.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.57,0:59:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我听说阿宾·苏尔的戒指选中了你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I learned Abin Sur's ring had chosen you…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.24,0:59:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说它一定是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said there had to be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.41,0:59:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see nothing to change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.49,0:59:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,基洛沃格 我来接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it from here, Kilowog.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.37,0:59:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,军团的力量取决于其最弱的一环\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corps is only as strong as its weakest link.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.25,0:59:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会容忍弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will tolerate no weak links.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.34,0:59:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.55,1:00:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕了 人类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you afraid, human?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.93,1:00:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.35,1:00:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.52,1:00:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.65,1:00:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,切磋下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.78,1:00:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.15,1:00:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sword?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.03,1:00:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}How human.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信我闻到了恐惧的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe I smell fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.72,1:00:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是绿灯战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Green Lantern.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.72,1:00:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.81,1:00:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,畏惧是意志的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear is the enemy of will.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.06,1:00:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,意志使你采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will is what makes you take action.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.44,1:01:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,畏惧会阻止你 让你软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear is what stops you and makes you weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.91,1:01:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你创造无力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes your constructs feeble.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.17,1:01:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须抛开畏惧 你恐惧 就无法行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must ignore your fear. When you're afraid, you can't act.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.42,1:01:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法行动就无法自卫 无法自卫 就死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you can't act, you can't defend. If you can't defend, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.02,1:01:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的恐惧恶臭扑鼻 哈尔·乔丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reek of fear, Hal Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宾·苏尔是位伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abin Sur was a great warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.73,1:01:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mentor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.81,1:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.98,1:01:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴着他的戒指 侮辱了他的声誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You insult his memory by wearing his ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.88,1:02:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不干了 他说得对 我只是个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done. He's right. I'm only human.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.69,1:02:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没准备好去保卫宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not ready to defend the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.68,1:02:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天前我还以为宇宙里只有人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few days ago, we thought we were the only ones in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.89,1:02:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指选中了你 你一定有过人之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring chose you. It wouldn't have if it hadn't seen something in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.72,1:02:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.93,1:02:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你自己都未曾意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you yourself don't yet see.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.31,1:02:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指从不选错人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring never makes a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.36,1:02:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次它错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.35,1:03:07.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科学楼）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.07,1:03:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最近 我们才发现…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That until recently, we didn't realize…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.57,1:03:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多被我们一直称为细菌的小生物其实不是细菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}that many of these little critters that we've been calling bacteria weren't bacteria at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.62,1:03:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是原始的原核细胞生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were an entirely different type of primitive prokaryotic cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.63,1:03:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些称为“古生菌”的小虫子并不为人所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}These little buggers, called archaeans, are still poorly understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.68,1:03:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许与细菌截然不同…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But might turn out to be different from bacteria…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.06,1:03:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许与我们所谓的细菌截然不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But might turn out to be as different from bacteria as bacteria is from us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.44,1:03:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人称它们为“嗜极菌”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some call them extremophiles…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.15,1:03:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它们生存在地球上极端的环境中 比如…\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they live in the most extreme environments on Earth, such as…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.78,1:03:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 太无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, he's so boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.07,1:03:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,温泉的沸水里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boiling waters of a geyser.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.91,1:03:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他耸样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.32,1:03:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克尔？ - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael! - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.08,1:03:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.00,1:03:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.33,1:04:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我耸样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just call me a loser?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.09,1:04:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是什么怪物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of freak is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.34,1:04:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Freak"?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.52,1:04:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,下课！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Class dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.15,1:05:03.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下午3点到我办公室 爸爸）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.57,1:05:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.82,1:05:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.82,1:05:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚很激烈吧 她叫什么 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you had a rough night last night. Did you get her name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.95,1:05:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡眠不好啊 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get some sleep, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.00,1:05:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐吧 - 叫我来什么事 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have a seat. - What can I do for you, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.17,1:05:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 你已经做过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, you've already done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.17,1:05:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我 为了国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me and for your country.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.42,1:05:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.09,1:05:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说 你给很多重量级人物留下了很深的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about you impressing a whole lot of very important people.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.60,1:05:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.39,1:05:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一个监管政府机构的下属委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a subcommittee overseeing the agencies involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.11,1:05:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝密 当然 - 是因为你 他们才选我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Top-secret, of course. - It was you. That's why they chose me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.44,1:05:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这个 你将得到内部的高级职位…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of this, we're gonna be able to get you a top post on the inside now…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.53,1:05:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,协助监管整个工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}helping to oversee the operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.37,1:06:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些科学家为此工作了一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are scientists that worked their whole lives for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.12,1:06:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 更优秀的科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-hm. - People more qualified.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.29,1:06:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没什么社会关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And less connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.75,1:06:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别天真了 孩子 世界就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be naive, son. It's the way the world works.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.67,1:06:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会出现时 你一定要抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to seize an opportunity when it presents itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.80,1:06:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他搞不成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.76,1:06:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪费生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wasting his life away.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.18,1:06:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人难堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.48,1:06:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔！你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill! Ha. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.98,1:06:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terrific.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.82,1:06:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 刚结束一个会 有很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Just finishing up a meeting. Got plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.10,1:06:52.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2312扇区 银河边缘）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.04,1:07:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到这个怪物诱导我最精英的战士恐惧缠身…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my own eyes I saw this creature induce fear in our finest warriors…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.47,1:07:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,并吞噬了他们的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then feed on that fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.39,1:07:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.97,1:07:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟踪了他的轨迹 他正向欧阿星进发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've tracked its trajectory. Parallax is headed for Oa.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.47,1:07:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未有谁胆敢进攻我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before has an enemy dared attack us here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.98,1:07:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须告诉我你知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.73,1:07:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,意志一直是我们唯一的武器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will has always been our sole weapon…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.32,1:08:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来对抗宇宙中的黑暗力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the forces of darkness in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.53,1:08:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可当这个力量还不够时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as that power began to seem insufficient…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.24,1:08:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中间产生了激烈争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}a great debate arose among us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.91,1:08:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否应该利用新的力量源…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we exploit another source of power…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.66,1:08:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发誓永不使用的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}one we had long since sworn should never be used?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.25,1:08:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.92,1:08:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧的力量太难以预测\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the power of fear was too unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.76,1:08:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,受腐蚀的风险太高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chance of corruption too great.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.59,1:08:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我们决定弃用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so we decided against it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.18,1:08:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一个人除外\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us, that is, except one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.89,1:08:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个守卫者一个人进入了禁殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone, this Guardian entered the forbidden chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.81,1:08:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想证明恐惧的光芒也是可以被控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to prove the light of fear could be mastered.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.94,1:08:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的出发点是单纯的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His intentions were pure…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.95,1:08:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望却是幼稚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but his hopes were naive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.87,1:08:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名守卫者被黄色的恐惧力量吞噬…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consumed by the yellow power of fear…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.91,1:08:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了我们要消灭的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Guardian became the very evil he had wished to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.62,1:08:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成了视差怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He became Parallax.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.30,1:09:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了宇宙和他自己的安危…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the universe's safety and his own…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.39,1:09:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宾·苏尔被派去失落的扇区囚禁视差怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abin Sur was charged with imprisoning Parallax in the Lost Sector.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.81,1:09:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.35,1:09:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸取了别人的恐惧 使他越来越大 越来越强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeding on the fear of others, he grew larger, more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.48,1:09:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正向这里赶来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is now headed here…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.81,1:09:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你们复仇 消灭绿灯军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take his revenge on you and destroy the Corps.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.99,1:09:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此 我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.83,1:09:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须准备利用敌人的力量 用恐惧对抗恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must prepare to harness the power of our enemy and fight fear with fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.75,1:09:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要保卫我们的扇区 我们首先要保卫自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect our sectors, we must be able to defend ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.13,1:09:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须铸造一个黄色戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must forge a yellow ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.68,1:09:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.85,1:09:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再为我担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have to worry about me no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.77,1:09:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.73,1:10:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,已离开 已离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gone, I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.32,1:10:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.53,1:10:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.70,1:10:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家站起身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.54,1:10:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们坐着我就紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me nervous When you're in your seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.96,1:10:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,难过的夜晚 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.88,1:10:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.22,1:10:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还吗？最近忙什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing? What have you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.22,1:10:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老样子 老样子 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Same old, same old. - Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.01,1:10:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔·乔丹 最糟的飞行员 或者最棒的 不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal Jordan. Worst pilot I've ever seen. Or the best. Not quite sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.06,1:10:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么的都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been called both.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.39,1:10:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you could make it, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到邀请我很意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a little surprised I got the invite.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.07,1:10:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人 哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're family, Hal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.40,1:10:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 这世界上有思想者 有行动者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are thinkers in this world and there are doers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.28,1:10:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个行动者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are one of the doers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.86,1:10:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可思想者使我的行动成为可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but the thinkers make what I do possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.53,1:10:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人事先设计 就不会有飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't have a plane unless someone thought it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.08,1:10:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.66,1:10:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我要去喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, I need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.25,1:11:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去工作了 这就是工作 - 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta get back to work. This is work. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.25,1:11:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 孩子 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice to see you, son. - You too. You too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.55,1:11:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.27,1:11:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我爸爸以前在这上面受训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my dad used to train in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.10,1:11:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你的裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was talking about your dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.27,1:11:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,西装不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.24,1:11:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我看的时候 你还没有西装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I checked, you didn't even own one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.57,1:11:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近在整理衣柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've been shaking up the wardrobe lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.45,1:11:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你们拿到合同了 你怎么办到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations on the contract. How'd you manage to pull that off?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.12,1:11:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们说 你破坏了交战规则才赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pointed out you only won because you broke the rules of engagement.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.66,1:11:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆在考虑增加军刀的飞行高度极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Tom figured out how to give the Sabres more altitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.96,1:11:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我猜 也许非本意 你以某种方式…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess in a way, without even meaning to…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.42,1:11:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮了我们一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}you actually did us a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.92,1:11:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.47,1:11:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,“英雄”这次词让我难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm uncomfortable with the word "hero."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.19,1:12:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢大家的光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you all for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.65,1:12:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.98,1:12:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个很特别的人我想感谢 帮我们拿到了合同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody very special I'd like to thank for helping us to nail this contract:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.95,1:12:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿 凯罗尔·费瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter, Carol Ferris.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.49,1:12:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.25,1:12:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 凯罗尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.21,1:12:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着你 年轻的女士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take one look at you, young lady…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.46,1:12:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者站在那里的哈尔·乔丹 如乃父在世…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or at Hal Jordan over there, spitting image of his dad…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.01,1:12:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦！- 你们就是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoo! - You give us hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.43,1:12:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们的未来干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toast to our future.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.35,1:12:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 听着！ - 为未来干杯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hear, hear! - To the future!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.35,1:12:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们后继有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.91,1:12:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈克特！噢 天啊！嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector! Oh, my God! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.00,1:13:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜… - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Congratulations. Um… - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.71,1:13:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬你和哈尔 我们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to you and Hal, the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.05,1:13:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, heh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.76,1:13:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道和你父亲一起 成长是艰难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it couldn't have been easy growing up with your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.64,1:13:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 你也干得不错啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, you're doing great, so… Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.81,1:13:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. I'm doing great. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.73,1:13:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过他说的对 我不是个行动者 - 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's right, though. I'm not a doer. - Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.56,1:13:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我最近有机会检验了一个外星人尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I did get to examine an alien body recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.40,1:13:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was very cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.11,1:13:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉外人 不过 你不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell anyone about it, but, hey, you can't have everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.86,1:13:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又在讲你的科幻故事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector telling you another of his science-fiction stories?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.28,1:13:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.45,1:13:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道何时该闭嘴吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't keep his mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.83,1:13:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实很有想象力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really do have a creative imagination.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.41,1:13:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.04,1:13:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.58,1:13:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize. We really must go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.25,1:13:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 凯罗尔 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, Carol. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.93,1:13:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.26,1:13:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.64,1:14:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.28,1:14:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, senator!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.93,1:14:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫急救队来 我们的直升飞机要坠毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the crash crew here. Our helicopter's going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.61,1:14:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.84,1:16:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.80,1:17:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚发生的事情只在数秒之间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened tonight took place in just a matter of seconds…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.97,1:17:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可人们会谈论好多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}but people will be talking about it for years to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.81,1:17:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一架直升飞机失控 险酿惨剧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A helicopter careening out of control, headed toward certain tragedy…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.90,1:17:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间 一个神秘男子 一个英雄 拯救了大家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all of a sudden, a mystery man, a hero, saves the day…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.24,1:17:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免了飞机冲进人群…\N{\fnArial\fs30}incredibly diverting the helicopter from destroying innocent people…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.03,1:17:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇迹般地拯救了凯罗尔·费瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and miraculously rescuing Carol Ferris.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.79,1:17:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是这位英雄是谁 他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real question tonight is who is this amazing hero and where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.34,1:18:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.55,1:18:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赛车道？ - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A racetrack? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.77,1:18:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的第一次亮相 你最拿手的就是赛车道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the best you could come up with for your first big appearance? Racetrack.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.35,1:18:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 抱歉 我让你失望了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. Did I disappoint you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.69,1:18:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用纯能量制造了一个赛车道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I materialized a track out of pure energy,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.21,1:18:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了几百号人 你居然失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving hundreds, and you're disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.49,1:18:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.78,1:18:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想看看 展示一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wanna see this stuff. Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.66,1:18:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 不太好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.37,1:18:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I wanna see this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.08,1:18:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看行头 飞行什么的 你得给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see the outfit, the flying… You gotta show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.87,1:18:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 做你最好的朋友可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal, being your best friend's no picnic.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.91,1:18:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 紧急情况下才用的！ - 你欠我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's for emergencies! - You owe me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.96,1:18:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 我想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal, I wanna see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.84,1:18:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.21,1:18:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴好你的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to your glasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.39,1:18:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.80,1:18:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,提问：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question:
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.39,1:18:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好灵魂出窍了？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready to have your mind blown? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.06,1:18:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.44,1:18:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.53,1:19:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.25,1:19:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是把戒指弄坏了？ - 我没弄坏 好吧 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you break it already? - I didn't break it, okay? It's just…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.63,1:19:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没水了 得充一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out of juice. I have to recharge it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.64,1:19:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.77,1:19:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！绿的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Green!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.11,1:19:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇噢 - 我说 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - I know, right?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.08,1:19:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错吧 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.41,1:19:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是超级英雄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.88,1:20:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是应该有个妞的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't they always get the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.79,1:20:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.08,1:20:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还未有机会跟你道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't get a chance to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.33,1:20:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.21,1:20:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没事 很高兴有机会能谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, no, I'm glad to have a chance to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.84,1:20:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我应该做的 不必谢我 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doing my job. No thanks necessary, miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.01,1:20:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该谢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.59,1:20:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.85,1:20:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我们大家的命 实在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved all of our lives. That was a very…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.27,1:21:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.86,1:21:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.19,1:21:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.36,1:21:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天… 天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Go… Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.24,1:21:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 哈尔！ - 你怎么知道是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! Hal! - How did you know it was me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.03,1:21:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？我认识你一辈子了！没穿衣服我都见过！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I've known you my whole life! I've seen you naked!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.95,1:21:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为穿了马甲 我就认不出你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I would recognize you because I can't see your cheekbones?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.04,1:21:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？你怎么变绿了？还在发光？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?! Why is your skin green? Why are you glowing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.96,1:21:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么还戴个面具？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is with that mask?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.25,1:21:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是行头的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came with the outfit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.72,1:21:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷吧 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.34,1:21:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都因为这枚魔法戒指？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it all works because of this magic ring? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.72,1:21:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是什么魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no such thing as magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.56,1:21:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河绿色维和部队 有几千人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intergalactic green peacekeepers, thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.35,1:21:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.90,1:21:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是瞎编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not making it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.57,1:21:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小时候 谁会想到呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, when we were kids, who'd have thought?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.65,1:21:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想过的 真的 我一直期待着 - 哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did, actually. I called this early on. - Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.32,1:22:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说：“有一天 我要成为绿色的太空警察” 我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "One day I'll be a green space cop." Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.16,1:22:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天在晚会上 怎么弄出的那个绿色的车道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so at the party, how did you make that big green ramp thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.33,1:22:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑子里想什么 就能创造出来 只需集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I see in my mind, I can create. I just have to focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.34,1:22:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.42,1:22:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.90,1:22:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 迟到好过没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday. Better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.28,1:22:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么工作的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so how does it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.11,1:22:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打你手机 然后说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just, um, call you on your cell,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.76,1:22:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,“天灵灵 地灵灵”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cat in a tree, downtown Milky Way"?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.58,1:22:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想可不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't think it works exactly like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.79,1:22:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 纯技术角度说 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically speaking, um…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.63,1:22:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually sort of, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.84,1:22:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.26,1:22:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？怎么退出？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? How?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.63,1:22:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 意思是 和退出其它事情一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, it's a lot like quitting anything else, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.76,1:23:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.14,1:23:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么连这样的事情你也会放弃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you walk away from something like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.60,1:23:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.97,1:23:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们都很清楚 我很擅长放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think we both know I'm pretty good at walking away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.36,1:23:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕一次 你不退出你喜欢的事情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If for once you didn't quit something you cared about…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.99,1:23:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,最差又能怎样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's the worst that could happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.63,1:23:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 今晚很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you. This has been really something.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.01,1:23:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我犯了很多错误…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I've made a lot of mistakes…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.93,1:23:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 我不是生你的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Hal, I'm not mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.30,1:23:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是替你难过 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel bad for you, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.85,1:23:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放弃了这么多 都成了习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been given so much so often.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.52,1:23:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.36,1:23:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.45,1:24:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩蒙德博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hammond?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.83,1:24:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西我想给你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something I'd like to show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.88,1:24:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很肯定 你想看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I'm fairly certain you'll want to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.60,1:25:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.06,1:25:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 再见 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - Bye, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.48,1:25:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.44,1:25:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,实体接触便可进入记忆系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Physical contact accesses mnemonic data.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.45,1:25:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到你的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see your memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.61,1:26:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.32,1:26:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, this is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.49,1:26:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我会弥补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.16,1:26:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让你好起来 不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you well again. Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.42,1:26:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.33,1:26:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们检测到了第二种外星生命体…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We detected traces of a second alien life form…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.92,1:26:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋藏在第一个的体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}buried within the body of the first.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.17,1:26:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.84,1:26:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子从未如此爽过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never felt better in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.56,1:26:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道了 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know everything, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.68,1:26:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子从未如此爽过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never felt better in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.37,1:27:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,被选中加入其中 是莫大的荣耀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be chosen to join its ranks is the highest of honors…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.29,1:27:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是莫大的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the greatest of responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.05,1:27:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指从不犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring never makes a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.57,1:27:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.41,1:27:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只需要做些检查 如此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just need to run some tests, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.17,1:27:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他保持昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him under.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.92,1:27:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.78,1:28:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.10,1:28:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈克特 - 嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hector. - Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.11,1:28:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.48,1:28:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.65,1:30:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指 它选中了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring, it chose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.32,1:30:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.66,1:30:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.87,1:30:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.58,1:30:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个外星人是你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alien was one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.38,1:30:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们如此不同？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we end up so different?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.09,1:30:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.01,1:30:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.93,1:30:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.39,1:30:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯罗尔怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how's Carol?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.77,1:30:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不该那样的 - 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That came out wrong. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.40,1:30:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我犯了很多错… - 听着 哈尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've made mistakes… - Look, Hal…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.44,1:30:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你感到难过 真的 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel bad for you, really. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.74,1:31:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我一样是悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just as much of a failure as I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.29,1:31:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just as afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.16,1:31:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.29,1:31:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在反抗恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to fight my fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.30,1:31:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我才尝到它真实的力量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that I've tasted its true power…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.06,1:31:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再回头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.65,1:31:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.30,1:31:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴的绿灯戒指曾经囚禁了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wear the ring of the Lantern that imprisoned me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.84,1:32:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会遭受同样的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will suffer the same fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.47,1:32:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经吞吃了你们的世界…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I have devoured your world…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.97,1:32:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经获得足够的力量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have all the strength I need…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.48,1:32:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败绿灯军团 消灭守卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}to defeat the Corps and destroy the Guardians.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.72,1:32:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.22,1:32:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里攻击行星的东西和哈克特有关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing that's out there attacking planets is connected to Hector?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.77,1:32:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它杀了阿宾·苏尔后感染了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow it infected him after it killed Abin Sur.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.52,1:32:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're just gonna have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.87,1:32:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我必须要阻止它 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm just gonna have to stop it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.90,1:32:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过 我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I tried that and I failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.73,1:33:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员死了 我告诉你 戒指选错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the senator died. I told you, the ring made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.24,1:33:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 往后倒 戒指怎么选错人了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, go back. How did the ring make a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.07,1:33:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯战士唯一的要求就是“无畏”\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one thing that a Green Lantern is supposed to be is fearless.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.58,1:33:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作内容就是“无畏”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fearless is the job description.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.33,1:33:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That isn't me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.54,1:33:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你这次又要一走了之？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna walk away again?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.09,1:33:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释一下 哈尔 请解释一次给我听听 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain this to me, Hal. Please explain to me just once, why.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.17,1:33:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm afraid!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.73,1:33:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你爸爸就从不害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think your dad ever felt afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.07,1:33:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使他害怕 他也有办法克服它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he did, he figured out some way to beat it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.07,1:33:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 克服它就一个词：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, there's a word for that:
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.12,1:33:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.59,1:34:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 如果没有过人之处 戒指是不会选我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that the ring wouldn't have chosen me if it didn't see something.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.30,1:34:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我还没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I don't see. Yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.31,1:34:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.02,1:34:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always have.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.89,1:34:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指没看到你的无畏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring didn't see that you were fearless.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.48,1:34:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看到了你可以克服恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It saw that you had the ability to overcome fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.57,1:34:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看到了你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It saw that you're courageous.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.16,1:34:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.33,1:34:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你爸爸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.34,1:34:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯侠是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lantern is a threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.92,1:34:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eliminate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.21,1:35:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的新武器造好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our new weapon is ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.04,1:35:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我掌握了它的力量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I've mastered its power…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.38,1:35:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会训练其他人效仿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll begin training the Corps to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.38,1:35:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然地球会被毁灭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though Earth will be lost…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.97,1:35:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,视差怪到达欧阿行星之前 我们会准备好对抗它\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be ready to make a stand against Parallax before it reaches Oa.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.22,1:35:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的力量将为我们所用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the power of the enemy will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.98,1:35:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,代价呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}At what cost?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.56,1:35:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你胆敢进入圣殿？ - 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You dare enter this chamber? - I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.86,1:35:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮助我拯救我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta help me save my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.91,1:36:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道人类不是最强壮 最聪明的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that humans aren't the strongest species, or the smartest.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.50,1:36:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们年轻 我们还有很多要学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're young, we have a lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.30,1:36:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们值得被拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're worth saving.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.31,1:36:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,新武器 你不能使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This new weapon of yours, you can't use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.81,1:36:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你越过了界限 屈服于恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you cross that line, once you've given in to fear,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.71,1:36:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法回头 我见识过\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll never go back. I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.73,1:36:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你们现在害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know right now you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.73,1:36:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胆敢指责守卫者害怕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dare accuse the Guardians of feeling fear?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.24,1:36:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.70,1:36:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么视差怪能打败你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly why Parallax is beating you…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.03,1:36:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们害怕承认害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're afraid to even admit you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.78,1:36:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.79,1:36:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一辈子都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent my entire life doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.96,1:36:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在地球上有句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we have a saying on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.71,1:36:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说：“我只是个普通人”\N{\fnArial\fs30}We say, "I'm only human."
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.96,1:36:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说是因为我们脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We say it because we're vulnerable,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.78,1:36:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说是因为我们知道我们害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}we say it because we know we're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.76,1:36:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不意味着我们好欺负\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't mean we're weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.14,1:36:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拯救我的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me save my planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.64,1:37:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要屈从于恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give in to fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.23,1:37:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败它 和我一起打败它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight it. Fight it with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.61,1:37:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话让人动容 年轻的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words are compelling, young human.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.15,1:37:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可做为不朽者 我们要以几十亿年的眼光来衡量我们的行为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as immortals, we must measure our actions over billions of years…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.99,1:37:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及宇宙的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the fate of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.32,1:37:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能赌上一切 来指望你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We simply cannot risk losing everything on the chance you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.99,1:37:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要赌上更多的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then don't. Don't risk any more lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.33,1:37:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.25,1:37:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去为我的世界抗争…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go fight for my world…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.17,1:37:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会证明 意志比恐惧要强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll show you that will is stronger than fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.34,1:37:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way you can succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.68,1:37:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死的 哈尔·乔丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will die, Hal Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.51,1:37:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得其所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll die trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.35,1:37:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 绿灯侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Green Lantern.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.87,1:38:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.42,1:38:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仔细看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.72,1:38:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真美 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's beautiful, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.76,1:39:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对她一见倾心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved her from the moment I first saw her.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.76,1:39:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她永远也瞧不上我 就因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she could never see me, as you were always standing in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.10,1:39:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以后不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.56,1:39:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 别 别 别这样 哈克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Don't! Don't do this, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.23,1:39:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.86,1:39:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.95,1:39:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 你看看你自己！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, look at yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.62,1:39:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know what it's like…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.12,1:39:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是让人失望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to not live up to expectations…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.12,1:39:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么都不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feel like nothing that you do will ever be good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.63,1:39:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道恐惧是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.09,1:39:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.26,1:39:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔 你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal. You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.39,1:39:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 世界末日了才能让你成熟起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wonderful that all it took for you to grow up was the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.40,1:39:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.28,1:39:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能变成你 我就让她变成我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I can't be like you, I'm gonna make her like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.61,1:40:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 如果她变成我这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let's face it, once she's like me…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.57,1:40:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没什么兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you wouldn't be very interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.91,1:40:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? Now, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.83,1:40:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么不行？ - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why can't you? - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.33,1:40:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不能变成我这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you be like me?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.59,1:40:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.34,1:40:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.18,1:40:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.69,1:40:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.02,1:40:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.74,1:40:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她来选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.49,1:40:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.54,1:41:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在放她下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now bring her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.58,1:41:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.54,1:41:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骗你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.68,1:41:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是骗你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied too.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.93,1:41:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the way it works is…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.10,1:41:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得被选中\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to be chosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.10,1:42:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have failed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.59,1:43:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.01,1:43:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.95,1:43:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意志很强大 可不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will is strong, but not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.04,1:43:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了戒指 你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nothing without the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.74,1:44:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须离开这个区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must move out of the area now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.40,1:44:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,街道疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please clear the streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.07,1:44:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,街道立刻疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the streets immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.33,1:44:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打不过它的 你会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can never beat this. You'll die.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.75,1:44:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我可以带它离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I can get it away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.75,1:44:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想怎么做？ - 我不知道 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you think you're gonna do that? - I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.84,1:44:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许可以智取 或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can outthink it or…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.42,1:44:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,打野架 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dogfight, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.43,1:44:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是两架战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were a couple of jets.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.09,1:44:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbeatable jets.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.51,1:44:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指选中我是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring chose me for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.35,1:44:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.73,1:44:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 也许我… - 不要 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I'm probably not… - Please don't. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.78,1:44:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.20,1:44:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,强制疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a mandatory evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.62,1:45:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人必须马上撤离街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone must clear the streets immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.54,1:45:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人必须马上撤离街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police emergency, everyone must clear the street now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.91,1:45:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody off now! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.88,1:45:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.47,1:45:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.37,1:46:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑！ - 啊啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run! - Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.68,1:46:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到你的恐惧在滋生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel your fear growing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.81,1:46:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be dead soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.77,1:46:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,白昼朗朗 黑夜茫茫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In brightest day, in blackest night…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.73,1:46:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 我将毁灭你爱过的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're gone, I'll destroy everything you ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.40,1:46:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魅魍魉 无所遁藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No evil shall escape my sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.57,1:47:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家 你的家人 你们的星球都将消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family, your home, your planet will be no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.45,1:47:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪科奸党\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let those who worship evil's might…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.50,1:47:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个人类的灭绝都是因为你 哈尔·乔丹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire human race will be wiped out because you, Hal Jordan…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.30,1:47:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,惧吾神光\N{\fnArial\fs30}were afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.01,1:47:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯长明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beware my power:
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.09,1:47:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,万世光芒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green Lantern's light!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.42,1:48:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,个头越大 死得越快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bigger you are, the faster you burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.96,1:50:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他戴戒指的时间不长…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though his time wearing the ring has been brief…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.51,1:50:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔·乔丹打败了视差怪将永载绿灯军团史册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal Jordan's defeat of Parallax will be remembered as long as the Corps exists.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.01,1:50:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的事迹提醒我们每个人 戒指选择我们的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}His actions are a reminder of why the ring chose each of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.81,1:50:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,克服恐惧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To overcome fear…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.31,1:50:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,击败邪恶 使其无所遁藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroy evil wherever it may hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.20,1:51:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯战士们 我们要以我们全部的意志去战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Lanterns, we must fight with all our will.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.20,1:51:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的意志从未如此团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our wills haven't always been united.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.50,1:51:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次必将团结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.79,1:51:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈哈哈 - 我是训练他呢 还是训练他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ha-ha-ha. - Can I train them or can I train them?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.67,1:51:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔·乔丹 你鲁莽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're impertinent, Hal Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.22,1:51:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,草率 反复无常 刚愎自用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're rash, volatile, opinionated.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.35,1:51:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来阿宾·苏尔找了一个和他一模一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems Abin Sur found another just like himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.56,1:52:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢 我永远也习惯不了这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, I am never getting used to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.07,1:52:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新工作需要到处旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new job requires that I travel.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.41,1:52:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.66,1:52:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开 却不离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away, never gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.17,1:52:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hal.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.55,1:52:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.26,1:52:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能摘下面罩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you take off the mask?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.60,1:52:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really cool. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.61,1:53:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 现在该干什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.70,1:53:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找点麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go look for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.14,1:53:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有戴过戒指的绿灯战士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the Lanterns who have ever worn the ring…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.73,1:53:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个的光芒最为耀眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was one whose light shined brightest.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.15,1:53:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初 他的人性被认为是弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, his humanity was thought to be a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.65,1:53:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来却被证明是最伟大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet it proved to be his greatest strength.
